{"id":"248908af8dc82492","group":"73","path":"73/73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion.md","title":"第三版 Chomsky 范式转换的兼容定理","display":"thm-restricted-cnf-conversion — 第三版 Chomsky 范式转换的兼容定理","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion","display":"thm-restricted-cnf-conversion — 第三版 Chomsky 范式转换的兼容定理","depends_on":["[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","[[73-df-generated-language-notation]]","[[73-df-cfl-notation]]","[[73-df-restricted-cnf-notation]]","[[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]","[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"aliases":["73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion","73-theorem-2.1"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§7.1.5, Theorem 7.16, print pp. 271–275; PDF pp. 293–297","source_status":"source-form-checked; construction-proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_numbering":"local-catalog; not book numbering","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"Legacy nonstandard interface; contrast Theorem 4.5, pp. 92–93; not the book CNF definition","legacy_source_status":"legacy-nonstandard-variant; not book CNF; side conditions retained","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":7},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-restricted-cnf-conversion — 第三版 Chomsky 范式转换的兼容定理"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0217e1a08a868eb\" href=\"?note=c0217e1a08a868eb\" title=\"73-df-cfg-notation\">73-df-cfg-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ade63126a30a65e4\" href=\"?note=ade63126a30a65e4\" title=\"73-df-generated-language-notation\">73-df-generated-language-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"351f87e03faac193\" href=\"?note=351f87e03faac193\" title=\"73-df-cfl-notation\">73-df-cfl-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"67f26c889bc89ed8\" href=\"?note=67f26c889bc89ed8\" title=\"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation\">73-df-restricted-cnf-notation</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"7505f1b37c6f6f74\" href=\"?note=7505f1b37c6f6f74\" title=\"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion\">73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion</span><span>73-theorem-2.1</span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§7.1.5, Theorem 7.16, print pp. 271–275; PDF pp. 293–297"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-form-checked; construction-proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_numbering","html":"local-catalog; not book numbering"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Legacy nonstandard interface; contrast Theorem 4.5, pp. 92–93; not the book CNF definition"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"legacy-nonstandard-variant; not book CNF; side conditions retained"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"7"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\">\\(L\\in\\mathrm{CFL}\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CFL},\\mathrm{CFG},L(G),\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{CFL},\\mathrm{CFG},L(G),\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span> 采用已列依赖。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CNF}\">\\(\\mathrm{CNF}\\)</span> 已统一为第三版无空词版本，不再禁止开始符号产生单字符。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\cap\\mathrm{CNF}\\;L(G)=L\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\cap\\mathrm{CNF}\\;L(G)=L\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\varepsilon\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\cap\\mathrm{CNF}\\;L(G)=L.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\varepsilon\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\cap\\mathrm{CNF}\\;L(G)=L.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先去空产生式、单位产生式和无用符号，再给混合右部的终结符引入变量，并把长右部二叉化。原来 L∩Σ¹=∅ 的限制只服务于旧笔记的错误范式，现在删除；空词例外则按第三版明确保留在结论中。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-cfg-notation","status":"resolved","id":"c0217e1a08a868eb","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfg-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-generated-language-notation","status":"resolved","id":"ade63126a30a65e4","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-generated-language-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-cfl-notation","status":"resolved","id":"351f87e03faac193","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-cfl-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-restricted-cnf-notation","status":"resolved","id":"67f26c889bc89ed8","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-restricted-cnf-notation]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion","status":"resolved","id":"7505f1b37c6f6f74","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-standard-cnf-conversion]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"L\\in\\mathrm{CFL}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CFL},\\mathrm{CFG},L(G),\\mathrm{CNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CNF}","display":false},{"tex":"\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\cap\\mathrm{CNF}\\;L(G)=L\\setminus\\{\\varepsilon\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\varepsilon\\notin L\\Longrightarrow\\exists G\\in\\mathrm{CFG}\\cap\\mathrm{CNF}\\;L(G)=L.","display":true}],"bytes":1921,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-149","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-thm-restricted-cnf-conversion|第三版 Chomsky 范式转换的兼容定理]]"}],"outgoing":["c0217e1a08a868eb","ade63126a30a65e4","351f87e03faac193","67f26c889bc89ed8","7505f1b37c6f6f74","0a6da8c909717780"]}